// ---- THE SABER ITSELF: one set, Graflex ----------------------------------------------------
//
// The original ANH / ROTJ saber, out of the owner's HD SFX collection. 48 kHz mono, which is what
// a sound carried in your hand wants: the engine places it, and a stereo file cannot be placed.
//
// ONE SET, WIRED STRAIGHT IN. These are the saber, not an option: no picker, no run-time switch,
// no second definition anywhere in this file. A font pack ships character boots and music stings
// next to its sounds, and a saber that recites a film line when you switch it on is a joke that
// stops being funny the first time. Nothing here is a voice.

ubqs/hum                     sounds/ubqs/fonts/f01/hum.wav
ubqs/bladelock               sounds/ubqs/fonts/f01/lock.wav
ubqs/off                     sounds/ubqs/fonts/f01/off1.wav

// the ignition, three takes of it
